rener- ally renewed this 6..0. As in many of the more thinly populated State. the country Moreltermers form • . majority of the member• of the State Legal..., it in I poi..e that one of throe •nti-Department Bil's may I some tome become law, If staid, the Donertment SWIM would carry the law to the courts, where its uncensti- tutionality would soon be pronounced. There I. not the les.l likelihood that the appeals to be made to the nomeroos legislatoreu will lose to the pewee of a single workable law. The interesting feature of the whole . mow Meet Is ill exemplification of the widespread ten- deecy of lite American moople to apneal to the legials. tares to protect them from the enthomic thaeges of the</p>
