        <p>CONSUMPTION. The most eminent Lung Specialists prescribe ANGIER'S PETROLEUM EMULSION in the treat- ment of Consumption and all chronic Lung affec- tions. It acts through the blood directly upon the lungs, and by its antiseptic power, tends to destroy the disease germs. while at the same time it has a Wonderfully soothing and haling effect upon the inflamed mucous membranes. Prompt to relieve Cough, promote appetite, aid digestion, and restore lost flesh, it is. unlike Cod-liver Oil, pctfectly agree- able to take. The oil used in ANGIER'S Petroleum EMULSION is obtained from particular wells, and is specially purified for internal use. Beware of imitations made with ordinary petroleum. Of Chemins. ajo and 46. • ILIMPLIIBOITL MINT FRES on receipt of 3d. to COS..' postage. MINX CHIMICIL CONPAIIT, Lbaltad, 3 SNOW HILL, LONDON. E.C.</p>
